    },
    "description": {
      "value": "The tip of a metallic dragon's claw is set into a band of silver. When you summon dragons using the claw, you must choose metallic dragons. After you cast a conjuration spell by activating the wyrm claw, you gain resistance 5 to acid, cold, electricity, and fire for the next minute. After you cast a conjuration spell by activating the claw, you gain a Breath Weapon activity that takes 2 actions and deals 6d6 damage with a DC 28 basic Reflex save. Choose the area and type of damage when you use Breath Weapon: a 30-foot line that deals acid, electricity, or fire, or a 15-foot cone that deals cold or fire. You can use this activity once before the end of your next turn. You cast gouging claw. Resistance when affixed to armor is 15, and damage from Breath Weapon when affixed to a weapon is 12d6 (DC 41). You cast summon draconic legion."
    },
